Subject: [PATCH 1047/5749] refactor(lsp): consolidate LSP tools - remove
 lsp_hover, lsp_code_actions, lsp_code_action_resolve - merge
 lsp_document_symbols + lsp_workspace_symbols into lsp_symbols with scope
 parameter - update all references in hooks, templates, and documentation

